WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Come into a deep squat (Malasana) with the feet together or slightly apart.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Exhale and twist to the right, bringing the left shoulder outside the right knee.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Wrap the left arm around the shins and reach the right arm behind the back.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Clasp the hands if available, or hold a strap between them.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Unwind and repeat on the other side.
